## Next Steps

1. Finalize the resolution of dataset annotation inconsistencies by April 2026.
2. Proceed with feasibility testing of the open-source model’s undocumented features.
3. Facilitate team alignment on strategic priorities through structured discussions.
4. Provide investors with monthly updates on milestone progress.

